                        "entry_id": "c011feaa-2319-387c-86f0-a57eed9ff8b5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "from the exterior, from outside"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ce1e82a-fc45-4874-8436-fa01b0aa5cf9",
                                "sense_id": "b48ba3c5-2e61-3e95-9e2c-3ca48fccd7ae",
                                "text": "The church, which is situated near the centre of the town, exteriorly resembles a huge Dutch barn."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2ad1bcfb-a623-396d-bceb-6522fa2079d3",
                        "entry_id": "c011feaa-2319-387c-86f0-a57eed9ff8b5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "on the exterior, outside"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ef720e1-a03c-497a-9abd-cc23642e3312",
                                "sense_id": "2ad1bcfb-a623-396d-bceb-6522fa2079d3",
                                "text": "The first evidence of what it was about to be, was the appearance of the drapery establishments in the city on Saturday morning; the windows, exteriorly and interiorly, being one mass of crape and green ribbon--funeral knots, badges, scarfs, hat-bands, neckties, &c., exposed for sale."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e253954-48f7-404d-93af-414611f73760",
                                "sense_id": "2ad1bcfb-a623-396d-bceb-6522fa2079d3",
                                "text": "The hotel was drab and decayed exteriorly; but the dining room was a continental elegance of marble, gilt, and mirrors."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
